# One regex per line. Lines starting with # are comments.

# Python's http.server (which links.sh uses) doesn't extensionless-strip
# the way GitHub Pages does, so /privacy 404s locally even though it's
# fine in prod (privacy.html is served as /privacy).
.*/privacy$

# The Mac-app DMG URL points at /releases/latest, which only resolves
# once a release exists. PR wr/enshittifier#16 renames the artifact to
# Enshittifier.dmg; until that ships, this link 404s but is the URL the
# site should use long-term.
.*/releases/latest/download/Enshittifier\.dmg
